  << /ActualText (First designer on the integrations and datasets squad\056 Took the dataset manager from a JSON editor used only by the implementation team to a self\055serve interface where enterprise finance teams could connect data sources\054 define transformations\054 and configure column types independently\056 Research moved from expert internal users outward to end users as the interface matured\056\nContributed to design system standardisation across squads\072 token architecture\054 component library structure\054 and the governance that kept Figma aligned with production through multiple releases\056)
